{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1582","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Kuzya and Homework"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kuzya started going to school. He was given math homework in which he was given an array $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and an array of symbols $$$b$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of symbols '*' and '/'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's denote a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"path of calculations"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for a segment $$$[l; r]$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$) in the following way: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Let $$$x=1$$$ initially. For every $$$i$$$ from $$$l$$$ to $$$r$$$ we will consequently do the following: if $$$b_i=$$$ '*', $$$x=x*a_i$$$, and if $$$b_i=$$$ '/', then $$$x=\\frac{x}{a_i}$$$. Let's call "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a path of calculations"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for the segment $$$[l; r]$$$ a list of all $$$x$$$ that we got during the calculations (the number of them is exactly $$$r - l + 1$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, let $$$a=[7,$$$ $$$12,$$$ $$$3,$$$ $$$5,$$$ $$$4,$$$ $$$10,$$$ $$$9]$$$, $$$b=[/,$$$ $$$*,$$$ $$$/,$$$ $$$/,$$$ $$$/,$$$ $$$*,$$$ $$$*]$$$, $$$l=2$$$, $$$r=6$$$, then the path of calculations for that segment is $$$[12,$$$ $$$4,$$$ $$$0.8,$$$ $$$0.2,$$$ $$$2]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a segment $$$[l;r]$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simple"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the path of calculations for it contains "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"only integer numbers"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kuzya needs to find the number of simple segments $$$[l;r]$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$). Since he obviously has no time and no interest to do the calculations for each option, he asked you to write a program to get to find that number!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$n$$$ symbols without spaces between them — the array $$$b_1, b_2 \\ldots b_n$$$ ($$$b_i=$$$ '/' or $$$b_i=$$$ '*' for every $$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the number of simple segments $$$[l;r]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1 2 3\n*/*\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n6 4 10 1 2 15 1\n*/*/*//\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1582G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1582/problem/G"}